### The screen's two bottom lines. Each line has a wide form and a narrow one,
### for a terminal under 62 columns.

screen-draw-bottom-never-answered-wide = personne n’a encore répondu à ce nœud
screen-draw-bottom-never-answered = personne n’a jamais répondu
screen-draw-bottom-alive-wide = quelqu’un répond
screen-draw-bottom-alive = quelqu’un répond
